IV. How to Use Google Pomelli AI (Step-by-Step Guide)
Step 1: Set Up Your Brand Signature
Open Google Pomelli AI on Google Labs 

Log in with your Google account 

Click Create Brand Signature 

Paste your business website link 

Wait for analysis 

Review the detected: Colors, Fonts, Tonality, and Visual style 

Save the profile 

Step 2: Create a New Campaign
Click Create New Campaign 

Enter your request in simple words (e.g., “Create Instagram posts for our sale.” )

Select the platforms you want 

Click Generate 

Pomelli will give you all visuals and captions.

Step 3: Edit and Export
Preview your content 

Use simple prompts to make changes (e.g., “Make text bold.” or “Use a softer color.”) 

Download your files 

Upload to your social media or ads account 

